# Pictures of a world for tuning (T3): who could join a faction, how everyone regards someone,
# and what a curve does across its range.

load content/sample

# The plane, law across and good up: @ is the Watch, + its tolerance region, and each letter
# a character, named in the key below. Good counts for a quarter with the Watch, so its region
# runs the height of the plane.
map city_watch

# Every observer's disposition toward the player and Vex; --csv gives the same for a
# spreadsheet.
matrix player vex
matrix player --csv

# A named knob as a table, then at one point: 50 at 0, 0 at 60, -50 at 200 (DESIGN.md §8.1).
curve disposition.affinity
assert curve disposition.affinity at 130 == -25.00
assert curve inertia.hardening.good.toward_good at 50 == 0.65
assert curve inertia.steady.law.toward_lawful == inertia.steady.law.toward_lawful: left out, so 1.00 everywhere
assert curve disposition.affinty == error: unknown curve 'disposition.affinty' (did you mean 'disposition.affinity'?)
